---
name: frontend-design
description: >-
  Make the Pawse UI distinctive and demo-ready instead of generic: consistent tokens, typography, visible
  agent progress, a hero moment. Use when someone asks to "make it look good", "polish the UI",
  "design the demo screen", or before the pitch.
---

# Frontend design

Judges remember one screen. Design that screen; keep the rest clean. The UI lives in `pawse/static/`
(`index.html`, `style.css`, `app.js`, `voice.js`; plain HTML/CSS/JS, no build step).

## 1. Respect the concept

Pawse is Mapify-inspired pink/gray (see [docs/AGENT_DEVELOPMENT.md](../../../docs/AGENT_DEVELOPMENT.md)).
Write one line in the commit before big changes: *"Feels <adjective>, the hero moment is <what reveals>."*

## 2. Tokens, not ad-hoc values

Colors live as custom properties in `:root` of `pawse/static/style.css` (`--ink`, `--muted`, `--green`
(the pink accent), `--paper`, `--line`, ...). Use them everywhere; add a token rather than a hex literal.
Type: one display font + one text font, big size contrast. Check `prefers-color-scheme: dark`.

## 3. Make the agents visible

- The agent run as a live timeline (status icon, agent name, short human label), not raw JSON.
- Show a "working" state within 200 ms of submit; stream results as they arrive.
- Clinic cards, cited policy clauses and the German script with subtitles as structured cards.
- Every simulated step carries a visible "simulated" label.

## 4. Polish (only after the story works)

- One entrance animation for the hero result, 150-300 ms, ease-out. No looping decoration.
- Keyboard and touch both complete the story; focus states visible; text never via `innerHTML` from untrusted data.
- Projector check: 1280x720, 125% zoom, readable from the back of the room. Narrow mobile width too.

## Anti-patterns

Gradient blobs, glassmorphism everywhere, emoji as core icons, six font sizes, centered body text,
lorem ipsum in the demo, tiny gray text on gray.

## Keep this skill current

Update the token list when `style.css` changes. Run `python scripts/validate_skills.py` after editing.
/* Pawse – sakura pink. Mobile first, big touch targets, one thing per screen. */

:root {
  color-scheme: light;
  --bg: #fff6f8;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --ink: #3a2530;
  --muted: #8a6b78;
  --line: #f6d5df;
  --petal: #ffc9d8;
  --soft: #ffe6ee;
  --brand: #c8487a;        /* white text passes contrast on this */
  --brand-strong: #a8345f;
  --brand-ink: #ffffff;

  --red: #d43d4a;
  --yellow: #f2a93b;
  --yellow-ink: #3b2600;
  --green: #2f8f5f;

  --radius: 20px;
  --gutter: 16px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body, #root { height: 100%; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}
h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }
button, input { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
button { cursor: pointer; }
button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--brand); outline-offset: 2px; }

.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.small { font-size: 14px; }

/* ------------------------------------------------------------- buttons */
.btn {
  appearance: none;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
  background: var(--surface);
  border-radius: 999px;
40:button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--brand); outline-offset: 2px; }
46:.btn {
55:.btn.primary { background: var(--brand); border-color: var(--brand); color: var(--brand-ink); }
56:.btn.soft { background: var(--soft); border-color: var(--soft); color: var(--brand-strong); }
57:.btn.ghost { background: transparent; }
58:.btn.small { min-height: 38px; padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 14px; }
59:.btn.wide { width: 100%; }
60:.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: default; }
252:.type-bar input:focus-visible { outline: none; }
253:.type-bar:focus-within { border-color: var(--brand); }
331:.clinic-actions .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; text-decoration: none; }
332:.clinic-actions a.btn { color: var(--brand-strong); }
367:.action-row {
371:.action-row.done { border-color: #bfe3cf; background: #f2fbf6; }
375:.action-row.done .action-text span { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; }
425:.result-card {
429:.result-card h3 { font-size: 15px; color: var(--brand-strong); }
430:.result-card .sim-badge { align-self: flex-start; margin-left: 0; }
488:.ask-card {
492:.ask-card h3 { font-size: 15px; color: var(--yellow-ink); }
493:.ask-card p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; }
495:.ask-card .small { font-size: 12.5px; }
535:.card {
539:.card h2 { font-size: 17px; }
540:.card-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
548:  .pc-callee.ringing, .bridge-wire, .step, .step.now::before, .ask-card, .sheet, .line, .cap-ai, .cap-user, .kw-chip, .result-card, .halo, .clinic, .sk, .ctl.nudge, .cap-user.partial::after { animation: none; }
552:.sim-badge { display: inline-block; margin-left: 6px; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; background: #fff3cd; color: #7a5b00; border: 1px solid #e6cf80; vertical-align: middle; }
587:.voice-picker:focus-within { border-color: var(--brand); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(200, 72, 122, 0.22); }
605:.card .voice-picker { align-self: flex-start; margin-bottom: 4px; }
617:.card.focus { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--brand); }

